  m_text: "Tap the screen at the right time to drop each ingredient. Try to stack
    them perfectly in the center to build the best burger.\n\n\n\nDrag the cone left
    and right to catch the falling scoops. Don\u2019t miss too many, or you\u2019ll
    lose valuable ingredients!\n\n\n\nFollow the arrows carefully to slice the pizza
    correctly, then box it up to serve. Accuracy is key!\n\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a021b6abbdf892847b346f47dfc6f979, type: 2}
